<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · 模型外面那一圈里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>一次动作从提议到落地，中间过哪三道</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.4}}>它能碰到什么</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 12}}>← 你们说「生产不是谁都能碰」</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.4}}>它做得对不对由谁判</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 12}}>← 你们说「变更要审批」</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.4}}>事后能不能还原</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 12}}>← 你们说「出事能还原」</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 26}}>这三道关不是给 AI 新发明的——是你们本来就有的。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>12 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
